# Code of the Paso contracts as it runs on Stellar testnet and mainnet.
# One line per contract: SHA-256, two spaces, path from the repository root.
#
#   stellar contract build && sha256sum --check .github/deployed-wasm.sha256
#
# Built with rustc 1.99.0 and stellar-cli 28.1.0. CI builds with the same two
# versions and fails when its result differs from these lines. After a
# redeploy, replace the hashes here; if the compiler or the CLI changed too,
# update their versions at the top of .github/workflows/ci.yml.
2ee1ac08ca6407667db15bcffe75c8cbb4e41d95b2d047541b5dad133cfe75ee  target/wasm32v1-none/release/paso_account.wasm
aeaa1c72f607071fd1f383638fa0c850df1c15bd051b3e1061ac57bc0e46b045  target/wasm32v1-none/release/paso_hub.wasm
